  thugs and placed in an asylum run by Professor Baum\, he observes the pro
 fessor's preoccupation with another patient\, the criminal genius Dr. Mabu
 se the hypnotist. When Mabuse's notes are found to be connected with a ras
 h of recent crimes\, Commissioner Lohmann must determine how Mabuse is com
 municating with the criminals\, despite conflicting reports on the doctor'
 s whereabouts\, and capture him for good.\n\nTickets: https://cstpdxticket
 s.square.site/product/the-testament-of-dr-mabuse-saturday-november-21st-at
